# Upload artifact, byte-for-byte derived from the tracked
# packages/zenodo/manifests_bundle/ tree. Committing it would duplicate
# ~700 KB of content git already has, and leaving it untracked would make
# --publish-ready report a dirty tree at the exact moment the operator
# runs it. Rebuild with scripts/build_zenodo_package.py.
packages/zenodo/manifests_bundle.zip
